    "taxonId": 900799,
    "summary": "Deciduous tree native to most of Europe, North Africa and temperate Asia. It is typically compact and domed, with nearly white leaf undersides, cream-white May flowers and scarlet berries. The berries are edible when overripe.",
    "humanEdibility": "yes",
    "edibilityNote": "The berries are edible when overripe.",
    "evidence": {
