    "taxonId": 438940,
    "summary": "Globose cactus native to Argentina's Catamarca Province. Its flattened, dark grey-green to blue-green body has curved pale-grey spines but no central spines. Red, pink or orange funnel-shaped flowers grow near the top.",
    "humanEdibility": "unknown",
